    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5dxj8gr",
      "content": "Kerala is situated on the southwestern tip of the Indian Peninsula, between 8°18'N and 12°48'N latitudes and 74°52'E and 77°22'E longitudes. It is bounded by the Arabian Sea on the west, Karnataka on the north and northeast, and Tamil Nadu on the east and southeast."
